Real discount rate | 5.77 per cent: 1.10 ÷ 1.04 = 1.0577.
What it tells you | The project is 2,050,000 out and 667,500 a year in for four years, with 340,000 more at the end — which Chapter 16 will discount. Note that the shield is a sixth of the annual flow, and that it would be worth nothing to a company with no taxable profit.
