Multiple-choice questions
P14-01  Answer A. Incremental cash flows.
B is wrong. Profits spread things that cash does not.
C is wrong. Absorbed costs include unchanged allocations.
D is wrong. Allocations do not change with the project.
P14-02  Answer A. The shield is its only cash effect.
B is wrong. No cash moves.
C is wrong. The terminal flow carries proceeds and working capital.
D is wrong. The shield is genuine.
